flowchart TB
  subgraph Desktop[同一台桌面机器]
    Native[robrix2原生维修应用与Rust权限broker]
    Web[Web回归与本地配对管理页]
    API[FastAPI 127.0.0.1:8711]
    Worker[同进程持久化作业worker]
    DB[(runtime/repair.db)]
    Files[runtime附件与会话日志]
